    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Clickoin</strong> is an addictive clicker game where every click brings you closer to a stunning collection of coin skins! With clever progression systems and satisfying feedback, Clickoin delivers a rewarding and stylish experience with every tap.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skin Drops:</strong><br>Every 15 minutes, you're eligible for a steam drop - up to <strong>4 per hour</strong>! The game checks for drop eligibility whenever you unlock a new skin through gameplay, giving each click an extra dose of excitement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Drop Rarities:</strong><br>Each drop is completely random and weighted by rarity:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Common \u2013 70%</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncommon \u2013 20%</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rare \u2013 9%</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Epic \u2013 0.9%</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Legendary \u2013 0.1%</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These drops are <strong>purely cosmetic</strong> and do not affect gameplay, but offer a fun incentive for collectors and completionists alike.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Clickoin</strong> is an addictive clicker game where every click brings you closer to a stunning collection of coin skins! With clever progression systems and satisfying feedback, Clickoin delivers a rewarding and stylish experience with every tap.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skin Drops:</strong><br>Every 15 minutes, you're eligible for a steam drop - up to <strong>4 per hour</strong>! The game checks for drop eligibility whenever you unlock a new skin through gameplay, giving each click an extra dose of excitement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Drop Rarities:</strong><br>Each drop is completely random and weighted by rarity:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Common \u2013 70%</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncommon \u2013 20%</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rare \u2013 9%</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Epic \u2013 0.9%</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Legendary \u2013 0.1%</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These drops are <strong>purely cosmetic</strong> and do not affect gameplay, but offer a fun incentive for collectors and completionists alike.</p>",
    "short_description": "Click your way through Clickoin - a sleek clicker game where every coin press brings unique skins! Earn up to 4 steam drops per hour, unlock stunning visuals, and grow your collection with clever in-game mechanics.",
